# Bazel options go here

# go.mod replaces container-structure-test with ../.., so gazelle's go_deps
# copies and watches the whole repository, this directory included. Convenience
# symlinks here (bazel-test, bazel-out, ...) would put this workspace's execroot
# inside that copy, and a Bazel 8 server then fails on the `~`-separated repo
# names a Bazel 7 server left behind in the shared output base.
common --symlink_prefix=/
